---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Home safety tips
section: safety
eyebrow: Safety
heading: Home safety tips
lead: Small habits that keep your family safe, season by season.
description: "Home fire safety tips from Bethany Fire: smoke and CO alarms, escape planning, wood stoves, generators, grilling, lithium-ion batteries, and brush fires."
---
{% set seasons = [
  {id: "all", name: "All year"},
  {id: "fall", name: "Fall"},
  {id: "winter", name: "Winter"},
  {id: "spring", name: "Spring"},
  {id: "summer", name: "Summer"}
] %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    {%- for s in seasons %}
    {%- set cards = safetyTips.tips | where("season", s.id) %}
    {%- if cards.length %}
    <h2 class="group-h">{{ s.name }}</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--3 group-grid">
      {%- for t in cards %}
      <article class="card" id="{{ t.id }}"><div class="card__body">
        <h3>{{ t.title }}</h3>
        <p class="muted">{{ t.summary }}</p>
        <ul>{% for tip in t.tips %}<li>{{ tip }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div></article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
    <p class="small muted">These tips are general guidance. For an inspection, a permit, or a question about your home, please contact the Town Fire Marshal.</p>
  </div>
</section>
